{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["We have no way to know his generation, and according to the plain sense he is not the son of Samuel. And know: every prophet who mentions his father's name — his father was distinguished. And if his grandfather was distinguished, he mentions both of them, as in: Zephaniah son of Cushi son of Gedaliah son of Amariah son of Hezekiah — until he reaches the distinguished one, who is Hezekiah the king."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:20.627428806Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}